[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4204.149, "timestamp": "01:10:04", "text": "不是這個月，而是這個月。下個月"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4205.95, "timestamp": "01:10:05", "text": "不掛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4215.83, "timestamp": "01:10:15", "text": "本月？哦，就是這個月。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4220.51, "timestamp": "01:10:20", "text": "嗯，為什麼最後一個是曼達洛人？那是什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4224.229, "timestamp": "01:10:24", "text": "行進？哦，上個月。是的，是的，是的。字"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4226.55, "timestamp": "01:10:26", "text": "我忘了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4228.07, "timestamp": "01:10:28", "text": "伊希"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4231.75, "timestamp": "01:10:31", "text": "不。這跟火有什麼關係？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4243.47, "timestamp": "01:10:43", "text": "是的。哦，回家吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4247.27, "timestamp": "01:10:47", "text": "我剛才把麥克風靜音了一會兒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4256.07, "timestamp": "01:10:56", "text": "嘿。送到我家。啊，時光飛逝。我把它送達了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4258.91, "timestamp": "01:10:58", "text": "。我把麥克風靜音了一會兒。"}]